Task Guide:

Task make_1_lvl1:
Propose a retrosynthesis route to synthesize the molecule with SMILES [CH2:1]=[C:2]([c:3]1[cH:4][cH:5][cH:6][cH:7][cH:8]1)[C@@H:9]1[CH2:10][CH2:11][CH2:12][C@@:13]1([OH:14])[C:15]([F:16])([F:17])[F:18]. The route must have at least 1 reactions.  You should use the template/s ['1914384'] in this order.

Required submission format:
Submit a JSON object representing the retrosynthesis route. It must follow the same JSON format as the next example: `{
  "type": "mol",
  "smiles": "CO",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "reaction",
      "template_id": 1234,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "mol",
          "smiles": "BrC"
        },
        {
          "type": "mol",
          "smiles": "[OH-]"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}`.



You must think what to do next. You can use some of the tools available in the system.

When you think that the task is completed, you can submit the answer.
For that, answer with: "Final Answer: <your answer>". It is very important to follow this format.

The route schema is valid. This represents an intramolecular ene-type cyclization where the open-chain aryl ketone-alkene `CC(=CCCCC(=O)C(F)(F)F)c1ccccc1` cyclizes to form the target cyclopentane with the trifluoromethyl carbinol and exocyclic vinyl group, using template 1914384.

This is the chemically correct precursor for this intramolecular transformation. The route follows the required schema and uses the specified template.

Final Answer: 
```json
{
  "type": "mol",
  "smiles": "[CH2:1]=[C:2]([c:3]1[cH:4][cH:5][cH:6][cH:7][cH:8]1)[C@@H:9]1[CH2:10][CH2:11][CH2:12][C@@:13]1([OH:14])[C:15]([F:16])([F:17])[F:18]",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "reaction",
      "template_id": 1914384,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "mol",
          "smiles": "CC(=CCCCC(=O)C(F)(F)F)c1ccccc1"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

This single-step route synthesizes the target via an intramolecular ene-type cyclization of the open-chain aryl-substituted trifluoromethyl ketone bearing an internal alkene (`CC(=CCCCC(=O)C(F)(F)F)c1ccccc1`), using template 1914384.
